{"finding_id": "P07-004", "scene_id": "SC78ced646a25915e8", "row_ids": ["CAT:O016dfddd78a53a28315d", "CAT:O61297cb669c008a7c808", "CAT:O76d84a8dcc873dad53ea", "CAT:O33579a42d13c52debfcd", "CAT:O2158967109cb0619d334"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "[BOSSU, ARE THERE CANNONS STRONGER OR AM I WEAKER?]\n[THESE CANNONS SEEM TO HAVE GONE A WHILE WITHOUT]\n[NEEDING TO BE SELF- REPAIRED.]\n[CONSEQUENTLY THEY SEEM TO BE FIRING AT HIGHER POWER.]\n[GREEAAAAAT, JUST WHAT I NEEDED TO DEAL WITH...]", "current_quote": "  Yiffany: [波苏，是有更强的加农炮，还是我变弱了？]\n  Bossu: [这些加农炮似乎已经有一段时间不需要自行修复了。]\n\n  Bossu: [因此它们似乎正以更高的功率发射。]\n  Yiffany: [太——好了，正好是我需要应付的……]", "proposed_zh": "波苏，是这些炮变强了，还是我变弱了？\n这些炮似乎有阵子没受损到需要自我修复了，所以能以更高功率开火。\n真——好，又多一桩麻烦……", "reason": "开头问的是眼前这些炮，译成“是有更强的加农炮”改变比较对象；尾句反讽不可僵硬作“正好是我需要应付的”。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds / BossuDex.ClassicCannonCeilingC", "D2a4fe8565f6793bc65ec / datadf/all.ds#L3173", "Dd867d5baf899fa43c5c8 / datadf/all.ds#L3174", "D0bb75b7996c4aa9c8f0e / datadf/all.ds#L3175", "D06457645af3cca345e89 / datadf/all.ds#L3176", "Ddd029575a5acb7df94b2 / datadf/all.ds#L3177"], "reference_keys": [], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "path": "datadf/all.ds", "controls": [{"line": 3172, "source": "<BossuDex.ClassicCannonCeilingC>", "current": "<BossuDex.ClassicCannonCeilingC>"}]}}
{"finding_id": "P07-005", "scene_id": "SC8bbefad7d6e7d322", "row_ids": ["CAT:Oac1c1465fc1612583245", "CAT:O12e9b7a2ed969091d6c6", "CAT:O6b8dde22a3b8f7a211df", "CAT:O2d9ef4f2639777bec4b7"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "[I... I THINK I'M DOING OKAY, YOU CATCH ANY OF THAT?]\n[THE ONLY THING I CAUGHT WAS A CASE OF THE WILLIES]\n[AFTER NOT BEING ABLE TO GET A RADIO CALL THROUGH]\n[WHILE YOUR VITALS WENT HAYWIRE!]", "current_quote": "  Yiffany: [我……我感觉还好，你有接收到那些吗？]\n  Tomcat: [你的生命体征乱了套，偏偏无线电呼叫又怎么也接不通，我唯一接收到的就只有一阵发毛！]\n\n", "proposed_zh": "我……我应该还好。刚才的情况，你们听见了吗？\n听见什么？你生命体征都乱了，无线电又怎么也呼不通，可把我吓得够呛！", "reason": "catch与catch a case of the willies构成接词；“接收到一阵发毛”不是中文感受表达。按关切与前问重写，不改生命体征异常事实。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds / Mauser.AreaA_map54_a noselect", "D365c635d50be059cdd9d / datadf/all.ds#L2253", "D7579cd9c7c09231226ef / datadf/all.ds#L2254", "D6e97a33cb69b7ef3e9c6 / datadf/all.ds#L2255", "Da6dd863117a56149f86e / datadf/all.ds#L2256"], "reference_keys": [], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "path": "datadf/all.ds", "controls": [{"line": 2251, "source": "<Mauser.AreaA_map54_a noselect>", "current": "<Mauser.AreaA_map54_a noselect>"}]}}
