{"finding_id": "P07-016", "scene_id": "SC290cf7270ee68e5f", "row_ids": ["CAT:O8c930c6f30d4eb18afdd", "CAT:O1c1221b9a0e792b6b87d", "CAT:Ocf5d1daf6e7846490b5f"], "severity": "A", "category": "gameplay", "source_quote": "[IN ORDER TO USE A KEYCARD, ALL YOU HAVE TO DO IS]\n[WALK INTO AN ENERGY DOOR WHILE HOLDING ONE.]\n[YOU CAN OPEN DOORS UP TO THE LEVEL DISPLAYED ON THEM!]", "current_quote": "  Tomcat: [要使用门卡，只需要带着卡走向能量门就行。]\n\n  Tomcat: [可打开等级不高于门上所标数字的门！]", "proposed_zh": "使用门卡很简单：带着它走向能量门就行。门卡上标着等级，等级不超过它的门都能打开！", "reason": "当前译成“等级不高于门上所标数字的门”比较对象循环，丢失卡等级控制可开门范围；同包门卡2说明佐证。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds / TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard0", "D54ff7fb879f38aebe5c5 / datadm/all.ds#L4302", "D57cfbaacbffea4e1e71d / datadm/all.ds#L4303", "D05d1cfcce9f4a58d256a / datadm/all.ds#L4304"], "reference_keys": [], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "path": "datadm/all.ds", "controls": [{"line": 4301, "source": "<TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard0>", "current": "<TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard0>"}]}}
