{"finding_id": "P07-022", "scene_id": "SC23fcdb3817e041e0", "row_ids": ["CAT:O2b0ac043813d13a5a929", "CAT:O616a36324a06d6d7df58", "CAT:Of6d39cdca438765df91f"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "Gifted beyond her years, with an uncanny ability to find solutions others missed\nthe ESPer Traeh seemed like a fine addition to the council.\nShe was readily granted access to the stores of power that we Fenfen kept.", "current_quote": "lang(Fox): 天赋远超其年纪，又有着总能找到他人所遗漏之解法的非凡本事，\nlang(Fox): 超能力者特蕾，看上去是议会的一位出色新成员。\nlang(Fox): 她很轻易便获准接触我们Fenfen所封存的力量贮藏。", "proposed_zh": "她年纪虽轻，却天赋出众，总能找到别人想不到的办法。大家都觉得，超能力者特蕾加入议会再合适不过，因此很快就准许她接触我们Fenfen储存的力量。", "reason": "“天赋远超其年纪”“所遗漏之解法”“力量贮藏”连续名词化不自然；保留曾被信任的过去视角，不提前将其写成阴谋已被察觉。", "evidence_refs": ["vsn/f_AgentFZ1/script.vsn / vsn/f_AgentFZ1/script.vsn", "V580becaa9c3042ce806f / vsn/f_AgentFZ1/script.vsn#L37", "V053b00b8109e70a30c9d / vsn/f_AgentFZ1/script.vsn#L38", "Ve24ac1344a68e23c5a51 / vsn/f_AgentFZ1/script.vsn#L39"], "reference_keys": ["H02"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "path": "vsn/f_AgentFZ1/script.vsn", "controls": [{"line": 1, "source": "music: FenfenBGM", "current": "music: FenfenBGM"}, {"line": 3, "source": "snap: FenfenIntroFemale", "current": "snap: FenfenIntroFemale"}, {"line": 4, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 10, "source": "cut(0.06): Black", "current": "cut(0.06): Black"}, {"line": 11, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 14, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenA01", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenA01"}, {"line": 15, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 20, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenA02", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenA02"}, {"line": 21, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 27, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenA03", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenA03"}, {"line": 28, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 35, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenA04", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenA04"}, {"