{"finding_id": "P07-023", "scene_id": "SC9e9ceda84c287300", "row_ids": ["CAT:O66f6b0f7415ea8f2c383", "CAT:O5e3999ec0497f3de3152", "CAT:Of46fb112c94cb3480dda", "CAT:O63a4ebed27b065fd6ccc"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "An arsenal of ESPer abilities became harnessed as weapons of war.\nExplosive psychic projectiles blasted away foes.\nPunishing waves of telekinetic force prevented advancement of armies.\nSome even went so far as to transform their very bodies into tools for combat.", "current_quote": "lang(Fox): 超能力者的能力武库被征用为战争的武器。\nlang(Fox): 爆裂的灵能弹将敌人轰退。 \nlang(Fox): 一波波慑人的念动力浪潮，挡住了大军的推进。\nlang(Fox): 有些人甚至走得更远，将自己的身体化作战斗的工具。", "proposed_zh": "各式各样的超能力，都成了战争武器：爆裂的灵能弹轰退敌人，猛烈的念动力一波波挡住大军。有些人甚至改变自己的身体，直接投入战斗。", "reason": "“能力武库被征用为战争的武器”重复抽象名词、施事模糊。整段保持技术描述与不同能力清单，不转成奇幻咒术。", "evidence_refs": ["vsn/f_AgentFZ3/script.vsn / vsn/f_AgentFZ3/script.vsn", "V332706f1b734f94d99e1 / vsn/f_AgentFZ3/script.vsn#L28", "V7dd6d6a5d4cdeb924455 / vsn/f_AgentFZ3/script.vsn#L29", "V0c68a41bc87d8d35303a / vsn/f_AgentFZ3/script.vsn#L30", "V11f27d6592ee516f63ca / vsn/f_AgentFZ3/script.vsn#L31"], "reference_keys": ["H04"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "path": "vsn/f_AgentFZ3/script.vsn", "controls": [{"line": 1, "source": "music: FenfenBGM", "current": "music: FenfenBGM"}, {"line": 3, "source": "snap: FenfenIntro01Female", "current": "snap: FenfenIntro01Female"}, {"line": 4, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 9, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenC01", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenC01"}, {"line": 10, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 15, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenC02", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenC02"}, {"line": 16, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 20, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenC03", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenC03"}, {"line": 21, "source": "rewind!", "current": "rewind!"}, {"line": 26, "source": "cut(0.06): FenfenC04", "current": "cut(0.06): FenfenC04"},