{"finding_id": "P07-027", "scene_id": "SC230a3742479654b5", "row_ids": ["CAT:O37b51f1ec51d96dcdd08", "CAT:O2622cf9df2e226d07507", "CAT:O09f88cfff6fe86260a8f", "CAT:O536e66f0fda01dd68df6", "CAT:O9ee446bde455d8ed32d6"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "[BOSSU, ARE THERE CANNONS STRONGER OR AM I WEAKER?]\n[THESE CANNONS SEEM TO HAVE GONE A WHILE WITHOUT]\n[NEEDING TO BE SELF- REPAIRED.]\n[CONSEQUENTLY THEY SEEM TO BE FIRING AT HIGHER POWER.]\n[GREEAAAAAT, JUST WHAT I NEEDED TO DEAL WITH...]", "current_quote": "  Yiffai: [波苏，是有更强的加农炮，还是我变弱了？]\n  Bossu: [这些加农炮似乎已经有一段时间不需要自行修复了。]\n\n  Bossu: [因此它们似乎正以更高的功率发射。]\n  Yiffai: [太——好了，正好是我需要应付的……]", "proposed_zh": "波苏，是这些炮变强了，还是我变弱了？\n这些炮似乎有阵子没受损到需要自我修复了，所以能以更高功率开火。\n真——好，又多一桩麻烦……", "reason": "男线独立记录：问眼前这些炮的强弱，而非是否存在更强的炮；尾句为反讽。与女线相同字面不合并人物经历。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds / BossuDex.ClassicCannonCeilingC", "D2da0b13ef37e89272217 / datadm/all.ds#L3243", "D92a998645b407ea935dd / datadm/all.ds#L3244", "D607e195df4a19a340159 / datadm/all.ds#L3245", "Dd70e46788b27d3afc323 / datadm/all.ds#L3246", "D8e2eba435163b9ebf0f7 / datadm/all.ds#L3247"], "reference_keys": [], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "path": "datadm/all.ds", "controls": [{"line": 3242, "source": "<BossuDex.ClassicCannonCeilingC>", "current": "<BossuDex.ClassicCannonCeilingC>"}]}}
